&lt;li>KCD - &lt;a href="https://community2.cncf.io/events/details/cncf-kcd-sf-bay-area-presents-kcd-san-francisco-bay-area-2026/">Kubernetes Community Days: San Francisco Bay Area&lt;/a>: September 1, 2026 | Mountain View, USA&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;a href="https://www.lfopensource.cn/kubecon-cloudnativecon-openinfra-summit-pytorch-conference-china/">KubeCon + CloudNativeCon China 2026: September 8-9, 2026&lt;/a> | Shanghai, China&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>October 2026&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
